DOWN CLOSER TO SORT OF 18 BUCKS

00:07:52.905 --> 00:07:54.841
ON THE BARREL LEVEL AT THIS

00:07:54.841 --> 00:07:55.208
POINT.

00:07:55.208 --> 00:07:55.541
WHY?

00:07:55.541 --> 00:07:58.811
&gt;&gt; BECKY, THAT HAS BEEN JUST A

00:07:58.811 --> 00:07:59.345
HUGE TURNAROUND.

00:07:59.345 --> 00:08:00.980
YOU KNOW BETTER THAN ANYONE

00:08:00.980 --> 00:08:01.881
THAT THE OIL MARKET IS

00:08:01.881 --> 00:08:02.982
NOTORIOUSLY BOOM TO BUST.

00:08:02.982 --> 00:08:04.851
BUT EVEN FOR THE OIL MARKET,

00:08:04.851 --> 00:08:07.854
THIS IS A COMPLETELY INCREDIBLE

00:08:07.854 --> 00:08:08.187
180.

00:08:08.187 --> 00:08:10.022
BECAUSE JUST A WEEK AGO OR SO,

00:08:10.022 --> 00:08:13.059
WE SAW U.S. OIL AND THERE WAS

00:08:13.059 --> 00:08:15.328
BRENT ON THE CHART, YOU COULD

00:08:15.328 --> 00:08:16.863
SEE GOING UP TOWARDS $100 OF

00:08:16.863 --> 00:08:17.997
APPAREL.

00:08:17.997 --> 00:08:18.998
THAT WAS SETTING OFF ALL KINDS

00:08:18.998 --> 00:08:20.766
OF ALARM BELLS IN WASHINGTON,

00:08:20.766 --> 00:08:22.802
WALL STREET, ABOUT INFLATION,

00:08:22.802 --> 00:08:24.971
ABOUT GASOLINE PRICES, AND THEY

00:08:24.971 --> 00:08:26.939
HAD COMPLETELY CRATERED SINCE

00:08:26.939 --> 00:08:27.306
THEN.

00:08:27.306 --> 00:08:28.875
AS FAR AS WHY?

00:08:28.875 --> 00:08:31.911
THERE IS A SENSE THAT THE

00:08:31.911 --> 00:08:33.012
BULLISH SENTIMENT GOT OVER

00:08:33.012 --> 00:08:33.379
DONE.

00:08:33.379 --> 00:08:35.848
THE PRICES GOT AHEAD OF

00:08:35.848 --> 00:08:37.049
FUNDAMENTALS, WHICH IS KNOWN TO

00:08:37.049 --> 00:08:38.885
HAPPEN FROM TIME TO TIME IN THE

00:08:38.885 --> 00:08:40.019
FINANCIAL MARKETS, ESPECIALLY

00:08:40.019 --> 00:08:41.087
IN ENERGY MARKETS.

00:08:41.087 --> 00:08:42.088
, YOU KNOW HEDGE FUNDS WERE

00:08:42.088 --> 00:08:43.789
KIND OF PILING ON, AND

00:08:43.789 --> 00:08:44.924
EVENTUALLY, THEY RAN OUT OF

00:08:44.924 --> 00:08:46.025
BUYERS, AND THE FUNDAMENTALS

00:08:46.025 --> 00:08:48.828
JUST DID NOT SUPPORT TRIPLE

00:08:48.828 --> 00:08:49.262
DIGIT OIL.

00:08:49.262 --> 00:08:51.831
DESPITE THE FACT THAT WE HAVE

00:08:51.831 --> 00:08:54.000
SAUDI ARABIA AND RUSSIA DOING

00:08:54.000 --> 00:08:57.203
BASICALLY EVERYTHING THEY CAN

00:08:57.203 --> 00:08:57.837
TO PUMP UP OIL PRICES.

00:08:57.837 --> 00:09:02.008
THAT STRATEGY HAD BEEN WORKING,

00:09:02.008 --> 00:09:04.010
AND RIGHT NOW, IT'S NOT WORKING

00:09:04.010 --> 00:09:04.410
SO MUCH.

00:09:04.410 --> 00:09:05.144
BUT FROM THE PERSPECTIVE OF

00:09:05.144 --> 00:09:08.381
CONSUMERS, HERE IN THE UNITED

00:09:08.381 --> 00:09:09.415
STATES AND AROUND THE WORLD,

00:09:09.415 --> 00:09:10.550
THIS IS REALLY GOOD NEWS,

00:09:10.550 --> 00:09:12.351
BECAUSE IT MEANS THAT RETAIL

00:09:12.351 --> 00:09:15.454
ENERGY PRICES, GASOLINE PRICES,

00:09:15.454 --> 00:09:16.322
CAN COOL DOWN.

00:09:16.322 --> 00:09:18.257
I TALKED TO A VETERAN ENERGY

00:09:18.257 --> 00:09:19.292
ANALYST HERE IN THE U.S., TOM

00:09:19.292 --> 00:09:19.725
CLOSE AND.

00:09:19.725 --> 00:09:22.261
HE TOLD ME HE THINKS GASOLINE

00:09:22.261 --> 00:09:23.496
PRICES IN THE U.S. ARE GOING TO

00:09:23.496 --> 00:09:27.433
GO TOWARDS 3:25 A GALLON BY THE

00:09:27.433 --> 00:09:28.401
END OF THE MONTH.

00:09:28.401 --> 00:09:30.369
THAT'S DOWN FROM AROUND 375

00:09:30.369 --> 00:09:32.405
RIGHT NOW, SO, THAT WOULD BE

00:09:32.405 --> 00:09:32.772
HUGE.

00:09:32.772 --> 00:09:34.307
THE OIL PRICE DROP, BECKY, IS

00:09:34.307 --> 00:09:35.541
ALSO VERY IMPORTANT FROM THE

00:09:35.541 --> 00:09:37.243
PERSPECTIVE OF CENTRAL BANKERS,

00:09:37.243 --> 00:09:38.477
BECAUSE IT HELPS THEM IN THEIR

00:09:38.477 --> 00:09:41.280
FIGHT TO GET INFLATION UNDER

